  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A white-hot jet of flame bores its way into the back of your neck, stunning your spinal cord. You hear strange noises inside your head as cerebrospinal fluid bubbles and boils!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You are temporarily paralyzed from the neck down, effectively gaining the @Condition[Unconscious] Condition except you are awake and aware the whole time. Roll at the beginning of each of your subsequent turns, needing to pass a <strong>Difficult (-10) Toughness</strong> Test to recover, removing the Condition. You also contract a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound} due to the deep burn.</p>"
    },
